`verilator_config
lint_off -file "*rtl/vendor/picorv32.v"
// picorv32.v's `timescale directive leaks past its own file (Verilator's
// TIMESCALEMOD check is project-wide, not per-file), flagging every other
// module in the build as "missing timescale". That waiver is applied globally
// via -Wno-TIMESCALEMOD in the Makefile's LINTFLAGS (not here), so it also
// covers `make lint`'s direct verilator invocation.
